---
// Quiz figure for Post 7: DuPont breakdown comparing two 20%-ROE companies (unlevered vs 8x leveraged).
---
<div class="qfig-sbq07dup">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 185" role="img" aria-label="DuPont table comparing Firm A (20% net margin, 0.8x asset turnover, 1.25x leverage = 20% ROE) vs Firm B (4% net margin, 0.625x turnover, 8.0x leverage = 20% ROE).">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>DuPont Decomposition: Identical 20% ROE</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bóc tách DuPont: Hai công ty cùng có ROE 20%</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="44" width="262" height="124" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="32" y="72" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Firm A (Software Moat)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Công ty A (Phần mềm)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="100">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Net Margin: 20.0%</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Biên lãi ròng: 20,0%</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="126">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Asset Turnover: 0.80× | Lev: 1.25×</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Vòng quay TS: 0,80× | Đòn bẩy: 1,25×</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="152" class="qfig-m">20% × 0.80 × 1.25 = 20% ROE</text>

    <rect x="302" y="44" width="262" height="124" rx="8" class="qfig-card-red" />
    <text x="318" y="72" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Firm B (Heavy Borrower)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Công ty B (Vay nợ lớn)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="100">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Net Margin: 4.0%</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Biên lãi ròng: 4,0%</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="126" class="qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Asset Turnover: 0.625× | Lev: 8.00×</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Vòng quay TS: 0,625× | Đòn bẩy: 8,00×</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="152" class="qfig-m">4% × 0.625 × 8.00 = 20% ROE</text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq07dup { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq07dup svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq07dup text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq07dup .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq07dup .qfig-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq07dup .qfig-m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-sbq07dup .qfig-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-sbq07dup .qfig-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-sbq07dup .qfig-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
</style>
